  m_Name: Radio_Initial
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueObject
  _currentLine: 2
  lines:
  - '*The radio seems to transmitting audio already. Curious*'
  - "\u2014porting again. It has been 2 days, 7 hours, and 24 minutes since losing
    contact\u2014..."
  - '*Hello? Can you hear me?*'
  - "Hello? Oh thank goodness you\u2019re here."
  - "This is Captain Sharp speaking. Listen, I don\u2019t have much time left."
  - "This planet, there\u2019s something connected to it. It woke up and that\u2019s
    when we lost signal."
  - "It\u2019s getting closer. \r\nIt\u2019s too late for me, save the others. The
    channel list is in the desk drawer."
  - '*A scream can just barely be made out as the channel is flooded with static.*'
